    "intro": "The Nike Jr Phantom 6 Low Pro FG/MG NU4 children's football boots are designed for young footballers who seek precision, control and agility in every action. Its construction combines Nike VNMSkin technology with Flyknit material to provide a grippy surface that favors contact with the ball during dribbling, passing and shooting. The new structure offers a more natural fit, especially in the toe, while the Nike Cyclone 360 ​​traction pattern facilitates quick turns and precise changes of direction to take advantage of every opportunity in front of goal.",
